      {
        "position": 1,
        "title": "Great stuff!",
        "text": "This dog flea collar worked well for my large rescue dog, who has a broad neck and a very active personality. I have bought collars before that looked fine online but ended up being too short, too rigid, or awkward once fitted. This one gave me enough room to adjust properly, and it did not look tight or uncomfortable after trimming. My dog wore it during walks, backyard play, crate rest, and car rides without trying to remove it. That made the whole experience much easier than I expected. I also appreciate that it does not require a separate daily step, because our routine is already full with feeding, walking, brushing, and cleaning up after a big dog. The scent is noticeable at the beginning, but it settles down and becomes easy to live with. For anyone looking for a flea and tick collar for large dogs, this is a practical, comfortable, and easy-to-use option.",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "August 10, 2026",
        "author": "Katie",
        "author_link": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AGT2GKBID4MBDSERUE6OLTRUE6NQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top",
        "author_image": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png",
        "verified_purchase": true,
        "product": {
          "size": "4 Ounce (Pack of 2)"
        }
      },
      {
        "position": 2,
        "title": "WORKS GREAT!!!",
        "text": "About a month ago, I bought this flea collar for my 4-year-old dog Rocky. So far, they have been working extremely well. Living in a forest where ticks and fleas are common, I have been striving to find a lasting solution that doesn't require local treatment or medication every month. This collar is exactly what I need. First of all, protection is real. He is very active, likes rolling around on the grass, going hiking with us and even jumping into the nearby pond. Although he has been outdoors all the time, I haven't found a single flea or lice on him since we started using this collar. It began to work within a few days and the effect was quite obvious. I also like that it claims to offer up to 8 months of protection, which is much more convenient than monthly treatment. The collar is easy to put on and adjust. Rocky's neck is thick, but it fits well and doesn't seem to get in the way at all. He didn't try to grab it or pull it off, which is a good sign. It is light in weight and flexible enough not to interfere with his regular collar or belt. In addition, the waterproof performance is also a plus point - Max has already swam twice, and the collar has not lost any effect. If I have to point out one area that needs improvement, I would say that the size recommendations for this product should be clearer. It suits my dog very well, but I think if the owners of large breeds don't measure it in advance, they might struggle a lot. An excellent collar is indeed effective. I'm sure I'll buy another one after this one is done.",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "August 8, 2025",
        "author": "Judy",
        "author_link": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AECB4OUFXADWLPXHN6ALIFLICSPA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top",
        "author_image": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png",
        "images": [
          "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qH9cAgFUL.jpg",
          "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mpUak6mQL.jpg"
        ],
        "helpful_votes": "6 people found this helpful",
        "verified_purchase": true,
        "product": {
          "size": "4 Ounce (Pack of 1)"
        }
      },
      {
        "position": 3,
        "title": "Very good",
        "text": "Finding a flea collar for large dog use has been more annoying than I expected. Some collars say they fit large dogs, but once I try them on my dog, there is barely enough room to adjust. This one had enough length and felt easier to size correctly. My dog is big through the neck and chest, so I was careful not to make it too tight. Once trimmed, it looked neat and stayed put. The scent is noticeable at first, with a natural herbal smell, but it was not overwhelming after it aired out. I also like that it does not require a complicated setup. My dog spends time on walks, in the yard, and sleeping near the living room, so comfort matters. He did not act irritated by it, and I did not see him trying to pull it off. For a larger dog, that is a big win. This dog flea collar feels like a practical everyday item rather than something I have to keep thinking about.",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "August 5, 2026",
        "author": "Cody carrillo",
        "author_link": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AGB2KR2UCIMPDGDSRW4D4N5B4VBA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top",
        "author_image": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png",
        "verified_purchase": true,
        "product": {
          "size": "4 Ounce (Pack of 2)"
        }
      },
      {
        "position": 4,
        "title": "Works",
        "text": "We’ve tried multiple collars and sprays, but none worked well for our toy poodle puppy. She’d often get irritated or the collar would fall off due to her size. This collar, however, fit perfectly and stayed on. She’s been using it for over a month now, and we’ve had zero flea issues—even with all the time she spends on the lawn. It doesn’t tangle her fur, and she hasn’t tried to scratch it off once. Compared to the overpriced brand-name collar we tried before, this one is just as effective and much more comfortable. Also appreciate the clear instructions and sturdy material. We’ll be sticking with this from now on.",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "August 8, 2025",
        "author": "Colet Frazier",
        "author_link": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AGVT3N36W3FGGNVAQT4S7UDWGGDA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top",
        "author_image": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png",
        "helpful_votes": "3 people found this helpful",
        "verified_purchase": true,
        "product": {
          "size": "4 Ounce (Pack of 1)"
        }
      },
      {
        "position": 5,
        "title": "Practical for a strong outdoor dog",
        "text": "My large shepherd mix is strong, active, and always curious outside, so I needed a tick and flea collar that would not feel flimsy. This one has been a good fit for his size. It was easy to adjust, and the material felt flexible enough to sit naturally around his neck. I like that the collar does not interrupt his routine. He can wear it during walks, around the yard, and while resting indoors. The herbal scent was stronger at the beginning, but it became milder after some time. That made it easier for our family because we did not want anything too sharp near the couch or dog bed. I also liked the low-maintenance part. With a large dog, everything feels like more work—bigger bedding, bigger grooming sessions, bigger messes after outdoor play. This flea and tick collar for dogs makes one part of care feel easier. It is simple, comfortable, and useful for a big dog household.",
        "rating": 5,
